---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, OPERATOR_NAME, OPERATOR_PLACE, DATA_DATE_LABEL } from '../lib/site';

const listings = await getCollection('listings');
---
<BaseLayout title="About This Site and Who Runs It" description={`Who runs ${SITE_NAME}, why it exists, how it is paid for, and what it has and has not done.`}>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
    <h1>Who runs this site, and why it exists</h1>
    <p class="lead">Flight schools price the same certificate in different ways, and few put their rates next to anyone else's. This site does, from each school's own pages, with the fuel and the hours spelled out.</p>

    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} is operated by {OPERATOR_NAME} in {OPERATOR_PLACE}. It is an independent site. No listed vendor owns it, pays to be listed, or reviews what we write about them before it is published.</p>
    {CONTACT_EMAIL && <p>You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>}

    <h2>What we did</h2>
    <p>On {DATA_DATE_LABEL} we read the public pages of {listings.length} flight schools and recorded what each says about price and fees. Every listing links to the pages we read.</p>

    <h2>What we did not do</h2>
    <p>We did not request quotes, call schools or fly with them. We have not tested any school, we say nothing about safety or quality of instruction, and nothing here is a recommendation to train at one.</p>

    <h2>How the site is paid for</h2>
    <p>Some links may become affiliate links, marked as sponsored in the page code and disclosed on the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> page. Whether a school or course provider has a program does not decide whether it is listed, where it appears or what we say about it.</p>

    <h2>If we got something wrong</h2>
    <p>Tell us and we will check it against the school's page and fix it. The process and a log of corrections are on the <a href="/corrections/">corrections page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
